{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-policy-gates","title":"CI/CD 策略门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/ci-cd-policy-gates","wordCount":1521,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-策略门禁\">CI/CD 策略门禁</h1><p>CI/CD 流水线是软件交付的核心通道，也是策略即代码发挥价值的关键执行点。在流水线的各个阶段嵌入策略检查，可以在代码部署到生产环境之前自动拦截安全漏洞、合规违规和配置错误。本章讲解 CI/CD 策略门禁的设计模式、集成方式和最佳实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"策略门禁在流水线中的位置\">策略门禁在流水线中的位置</h2><p>策略检查不是流水线中的单一阶段，而是应该分布在流水线的多个检查点上，形成纵深防御。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 开发阶段&#10;        C1[代码提交] --&gt; P1[Pre-commit&lt;br/&gt;静态检查]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CI 阶段&#10;        P1 --&gt; C2[构建 + 单元测试]&#10;        C2 --&gt; P2[安全扫描&lt;br/&gt;SAST/依赖]&#10;        P2 --&gt; C3[制品构建]&#10;        C3 --&gt; P3[制品扫描&lt;br/&gt;镜像/二进制]&#10;        P3 --&gt; C4[部署计划&lt;br/&gt;Terraform Plan]&#10;        C4 --&gt; P4[配置策略&lt;br/&gt;Conftest/OPA]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CD 阶段&#10;        P4 --&gt; C5[部署到预发]&#10;        C5 --&gt; P5[集成测试 + 合规]&#10;        P5 --&gt; C6[部署到生产]&#10;        C6 --&gt; P6[运行时检查&lt;br/&gt;持续合规]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 开发阶段\n        C1[代码提交] --&gt; P1[Pre-commit&lt;br/&gt;静态检查]\n    end\n    subgraph CI 阶段\n        P1 --&gt; C2[构建 + 单元测试]\n        C2 --&gt; P2[安全扫描&lt;br/&gt;SAST/依赖]\n        P2 --&gt; C3[制品构建]\n        C3 --&gt; P3[制品扫描&lt;br/&gt;镜像/二进制]\n        P3 --&gt; C4[部署计划&lt;br/&gt;Terraform Plan]\n        C4 --&gt; P4[配置策略&lt;br/&gt;Conftest/OPA]\n    end\n    subgraph CD 阶段\n        P4 --&gt; C5[部署到预发]\n        C5 --&gt; P5[集成测试 + 合规]\n        P5 --&gt; C6[部署到生产]\n        C6 --&gt; P6[运行时检查&lt;br/&gt;持续合规]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查点</th>\n<th>策略类型</th>\n<th>工具示例</th>\n<th>失败影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pre-commit</td>\n<td>代码格式、基础安全</td>\n<td>pre-commit、Conftest HCL</td>\n<td>本地提交被阻止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 构建</td>\n<td>SAST、依赖漏洞</td>\n<td>SonarQube、Trivy、Snyk</td>\n<td>流水线失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制品扫描</td>\n<td>镜像漏洞、SBOM</td>\n<td>Trivy、Anchore、Cosign</td>\n<td>制品不被推送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署计划</td>\n<td>IaC 合规、成本</td>\n<td>Conftest、OPA、Infracost</td>\n<td>部署被阻止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预发验证</td>\n<td>集成合规、运行时</td>\n<td>OPA、Kyverno audit</td>\n<td>不推进到生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产运行时</td>\n<td>持续合规审计</td>\n<td>Kyverno、AWS Config</td>\n<td>生成违规报告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>纵深防御原则：</strong> 不要依赖单一检查点。同一条安全规则（如&quot;禁止使用公网 SSH&quot;）应该在 Pre-commit（HCL 检查）、CI（Terraform plan 检查）和运行时（云资源审计）三个层面分别检查，确保任何层面的绕过都能被捕获。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"门禁策略设计\">门禁策略设计</h2><p>有效的 CI/CD 策略门禁需要精心设计策略的严重程度和处理方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略严重度分级\">策略严重度分级</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>示例策略</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Blocker</strong></td>\n<td>立即失败，阻止流水线继续</td>\n<td>包含已知 Critical CVE、密钥泄露</td>\n<td>所有阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Error</strong></td>\n<td>失败，但允许特定角色覆盖</td>\n<td>缺少必需标签、镜像来自非受信仓库</td>\n<td>CI/CD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Warning</strong></td>\n<td>显示警告，不阻塞流水线</td>\n<td>建议添加健康检查、资源限制偏低</td>\n<td>所有阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Info</strong></td>\n<td>仅记录信息</td>\n<td>检测到新依赖、配置变更摘要</td>\n<td>所有阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[策略评估结果] --&gt; S{严重度}&#10;    S --&gt; |Blocker| B[流水线失败&lt;br/&gt;不可覆盖]&#10;    S --&gt; |Error| E[流水线失败&lt;br/&gt;授权角色可覆盖]&#10;    S --&gt; |Warning| W[标记警告&lt;br/&gt;继续执行]&#10;    S --&gt; |Info| I[记录日志&lt;br/&gt;继续执行]\">graph TD\n    R[策略评估结果] --&gt; S{严重度}\n    S --&gt; |Blocker| B[流水线失败&lt;br/&gt;不可覆盖]\n    S --&gt; |Error| E[流水线失败&lt;br/&gt;授权角色可覆盖]\n    S --&gt; |Warning| W[标记警告&lt;br/&gt;继续执行]\n    S --&gt; |Info| I[记录日志&lt;br/&gt;继续执行]</pre><h3 id=\"策略门禁的反馈机制\">策略门禁的反馈机制</h3><p>策略检查失败时，提供清晰、可操作的反馈至关重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反馈渠道</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>最佳实践</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流水线日志</td>\n<td>直接在 CI 输出中显示</td>\n<td>按严重度着色，列出具体违规项和修复建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 评论</td>\n<td>在 Pull Request 中自动评论</td>\n<td>只评论增量变更相关的违规，避免噪音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态检查</td>\n<td>GitHub Status Check / GitLab Approval</td>\n<td>区分 required 和 optional 检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SARIF 报告</td>\n<td>安全扫描结果的标准格式</td>\n<td>集成到 GitHub Security 或安全仪表板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知</td>\n<td>Slack/飞书/邮件通知</td>\n<td>仅 Blocker 和 Error 级别触发通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-集成\">GitHub Actions 集成</h2><p>GitHub Actions 是最流行的 CI/CD 平台之一，其生态中有丰富的策略检查工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"完整流水线示例\">完整流水线示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Policy-Gated CI/CD&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: read&#10;  security-events: write&#10;  pull-requests: write&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  policy-gates:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      # 门禁 1: IaC 静态检查&#10;      - name: Setup Conftest&#10;        uses: instrumenta/conftest-action/setup@master&#10;        with:&#10;          version: v0.50.0&#10;&#10;      - name: Terraform HCL Policy Check&#10;        run: conftest test terraform/ --parser hcl --all-namespaces&#10;        continue-on-error: false&#10;&#10;      # 门禁 2: 依赖漏洞扫描&#10;      - name: Run Trivy vulnerability scanner&#10;        uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master&#10;        with:&#10;          scan-type: &#39;fs&#39;&#10;          scan-ref: &#39;.&#39;&#10;          format: &#39;sarif&#39;&#10;          output: &#39;trivy-results.sarif&#39;&#10;          severity: &#39;CRITICAL,HIGH&#39;&#10;          exit-code: &#39;1&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Upload Trivy scan results&#10;        uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          sarif_file: &#39;trivy-results.sarif&#39;&#10;&#10;      # 门禁 3: 镜像构建与扫描&#10;      - name: Build image&#10;        run: docker build -t myapp:${{ github.sha }} .&#10;&#10;      - name: Scan Docker image&#10;        uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master&#10;        with:&#10;          image-ref: &#39;myapp:${{ github.sha }}&#39;&#10;          format: &#39;table&#39;&#10;          severity: &#39;CRITICAL,HIGH,MEDIUM&#39;&#10;          exit-code: &#39;0&#39; # 警告模式，不阻塞&#10;          ignore-unfixed: true&#10;&#10;      # 门禁 4: OPA 自定义策略&#10;      - name: Setup OPA&#10;        run: |&#10;          curl -L -o opa https://openpolicyagent.org/downloads/v0.68.0/opa_linux_amd64&#10;          chmod +x opa &amp;&amp; sudo mv opa /usr/local/bin/&#10;&#10;      - name: Evaluate deployment policies&#10;        run: |&#10;          opa exec \\&#10;            --decision data.pipelines.allow \\&#10;            --bundle policy/ \\&#10;            --set &quot;input.pr.author=${{ github.actor }}&quot; \\&#10;            --set &quot;input.pr.changed_files=$(git diff --name-only origin/main)&quot; \\&#10;            k8s/&#10;&#10;  deploy-staging:&#10;    needs: policy-gates&#10;    if: github.ref == &#39;refs/heads/main&#39;&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    environment: staging&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Deploy to Staging&#10;        run: kubectl apply -f k8s/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Policy-Gated CI/CD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  security-events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull-requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policy-gates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 门禁 1: IaC 静态检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup Conftest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">instrumenta/conftest-action/setup@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v0.50.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Terraform HCL Policy Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">conftest test terraform/ --parser hcl --all-namespaces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        continue-on-error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 门禁 2: 依赖漏洞扫描</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run Trivy vulnerability scanner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aquasecurity/trivy-action@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          scan-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fs'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          scan-ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sarif'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'trivy-results.sarif'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CRITICAL,HIGH'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          exit-code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Upload Trivy scan results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          sarif_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'trivy-results.sarif'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 门禁 3: 镜像构建与扫描</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color: